ing on their choice of programme, be it the African Masters in Machine Intelligence (AMMI), the MSc Mathematical Sciences (Structured\/Regular Masters) or the MSc Mathematical Sciences for Teachers (MMST). The student population also varies each year however we prefer to focus more on the quality of students we bring out.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are in STEM, with interests in the Mathematical Sciences, AIMS is truly the place to be.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-adv-tabs advgb-tabs-wrapper advgb-tab-horz-desktop advgb-tab-vert-tablet advgb-tab-stack-mobile advgb-tabs-77c27c03-0b67-4090-bbde-158cd30e552f\" data-tab-active=\"0\"><ul class=\"advgb-tabs-panel\"><li class=\"advgb-tab\" style=\"background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px\"><a id=\"\" href=\"#advgb-tabs-tab0\" style=\"color:#fff\"><span>Structured Masters 2025\/26<\/span><\/a><\/li><li class=\"advgb-tab\" style=\"background-color:#e0e0e0;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px\"><a id=\"\" href=\"#advgb-tabs-tab1\" style=\"color:#fff\"><span>MMST 2024\/26<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-wrapper\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:10px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container\"><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-\">Structured Masters 2025\/26<\/div><div class=\"advgb-tab-_a29937-6e advgb-tab-body\" aria-labelledby=\"advgb-tabs-tab0\">\n<div class=\"row w-00\">        \n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4 col-lg-3 no-class-spacer\"> \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"profile-card-img img-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/11\/AkotchayeChristianAkoutan-Ayaka.jpg')\">\n\n\n\n\n\n <\/div>\n<div class=\"profile-card-bottom pad-5 bg-primary center-text\"> \n\n<div class=\"profile-card-name white-text center-text sans-serif-bold\"><p> <strong> Akotchaye\u0301 Christian Akoutan-Ayaka <\/strong><\/p><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"profile-car